      <article class="legal-content">
<h2>Appointments</h2><p>If you need to cancel or change a demo appointment, contact Classic Technologies as early as possible so the schedule can be updated.</p>
<h2>Setup and subscription fees</h2><p>Some setup, deployment, support, subscription, module addon, SMS, email, payment, storage, or infrastructure costs may be non-refundable once activated, consumed, or provided by third parties.</p>
<h2>Trials and grace periods</h2><p>The platform blueprint supports configurable trials, expiry reminders, invoice creation, grace periods, restriction, suspension, and reactivation. Exact billing rules depend on the tenant agreement.</p>
<h2>Disputes</h2><p>For billing or service concerns, contact support with tenant name, invoice reference, module, date, and a clear explanation. The team will review and respond with the next step.</p>
      </article>
